==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal Enemies]] are predominant here, with the Metal Hippoes being somewhat difficult supports if you don't have any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|critters]]. Otherwise, bring some [[:Category:anti-Red Cats|anti-Red Cats]] (to deal with the St. Pigge the 2nd), ranged attackers, and critters to beat this stage.

